      "value": "Thank you for the suggestion!\n\nVRChat added 'Earmuffs' last year, which allows you to reduce the distance at which you can hear other players.\n\nWe'll soon be launching 'Cozy Earmuffs', which will further enhance this feature.\n\nLet us know if you have any more feedback ♥",
