  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When I'm surrounded by people having separate conversations, I have trouble listening to the person I'm trying to have a direct conversation with. I'd like to see a second slider next to the voice volume slider that adjusts your personal listening range. For example, when having a conversation you could lower the listen range to something like 5 meters, which would significantly reduce the volume of anyone outside that range.",
